      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Max arrives five minutes late and calls Chef Barinov a 'mustachioed walrus,' so Lyova punishes him by making him haul out all the trash—where Max confronts a rude driver blocking the walkway. Listen to the Russian dialogue first.",
